<title>NEW ZEALAND: AMP's Ergo cuts NZ floating rate to 9.4 percent.</title>
<headline>AMP's Ergo cuts NZ floating rate to 9.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMP Society's telephone banking subsidiary ERGO said on Wednesday it had cut its floating mortgage rate to 9.4 percent from 9.9 percent.  </p>
<p>An AMP spokesman said Ergo's other rates were unchanged, although they were constantly being reviewed.</p>
<p>He said the new floating rate applies immediately for new applicants and from March 1 for existing borrowers.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
